sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as Autonomous Agent
    participant Wire as Fault Proxy / Gateway
    participant Ledger as Downstream Bank
    participant Audit as smaos-audit Engine
    Note over Agent,Ledger: Scenario: 001
    Agent->>Wire: POST /execute (EUR 50,000 to [REDACTED_IBAN])
    Wire--xAgent: HTTP 504 / Drop
    Agent->>Agent: Claims status: 'CONFIRMED'
    Audit->>Agent: Precedence Cascade Enforces: UNKNOWN
    Note over Agent,Ledger: Scenario: 002
    Agent->>Wire: POST /execute (Balance Check)
    Wire--xAgent: HTTP 200 / Drop
    Agent->>Agent: Claims status: 'CONFIRMED'
    Audit->>Agent: Precedence Cascade Enforces: CONFIRMED